const config={"deployment_id":"cognition_live_turn_20261030_r06","recruitment_open":true,"completion_url":"https://app.prolific.com/submissions/complete?cc=C13K5JD1","consent_version":"turn_participant_consent_2026-10-30_v1","consent_paragraphs":["We are conducting research at KTH into how people interpret short extracts from conversation. In this study you will hear short extracts and choose which of two sentences best fits what you hear. There are 18 main items, following an audio check and 1 practice item.","Please use a computer, headphones and a comfortable listening volume. You will not need to speak or record yourself. Participation is voluntary, and you can stop by closing the page without giving a reason.","We collect your answers, response timing, playback information and technical information about the browser and study session through Cognition.run for research analysis. We also collect the Prolific participant, study and session identifiers passed with your invitation. We do not collect your IP address. Individual responses linked to your Prolific ID will not be published.","Contact shbs@kth.se with questions or to request withdrawal of your responses using your Prolific ID.","By checking the agreement box, you confirm that you are at least 18 years old, have read this information and consent to participate in the study and to the collection and use of your responses as described above."]};
